{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "五类缺陷",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 159.49,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "合约里的数学缺陷，可以分成五类。",
   "spoken": "合约里的数学缺陷，可以分成五类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.293
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "溢出，截断，先除后乘，舍入方向，单位不一致。",
   "spoken": "溢出，截断，先除后乘，舍入方向，单位不一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.348,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 5.446,
   "speechEnd": 10.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "第一类，溢出。整数有上限，超过上限，结果会回绕。",
   "spoken": "第一类，溢出。整数有上限，超过上限，结果会回绕。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.496,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 11.594,
   "speechEnd": 16.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "2018 年 4 月，以太坊上的 BEC 代币，栽在批量转账上。",
   "spoken": "2018 年 4 月，以太坊上的 BEC 代币，栽在批亮转账上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.004,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 18.102,
   "speechEnd": 22.506
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "合约用 0.4 版的 Solidity 写成，没有溢出检查。",
   "spoken": "合约用 0.4 版的 Solidity 写成，没有溢出检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.552,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 23.65,
   "speechEnd": 27.197
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "函数先算总额：接收人数，乘以每人的金额。",
   "spoken": "函数先算总额：接收人数，乘以每人的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.26,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 28.358,
   "speechEnd": 32.155
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "攻击者填了 2 个接收地址，每人 2 的 255 次方。",
   "spoken": "攻击者填了 2 个接收地址，每人 2 的 255 次方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.208,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 33.306,
   "speechEnd": 37.448
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "2 乘以 2 的 255 次方，是 2 的 256 次方。",
   "spoken": "2 乘以 2 的 255 次方，是 2 的 256 次方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.492,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 38.59,
   "speechEnd": 42.304
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "它刚好超出 256 位整数的上限，回绕成了 0。",
   "spoken": "它刚好超出 256 位整数的上限，回绕成了 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.344,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 43.442,
   "speechEnd": 47.418
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "余额检查比较的是 0，直接通过。发送者被扣掉的，也是 0。",
   "spoken": "余额检查比较的是 0，直接通过。发送者被扣掉的，也是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.46,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 48.558,
   "speechEnd": 53.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "两个接收者，却各自收到 2 的 255 次方。",
   "spoken": "两个接收者，却各自收到 2 的 255 次方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.92,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 55.018,
   "speechEnd": 58.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "代币凭空出现。按公开报道，多家交易所暂停了 BEC 充提。",
   "spoken": "代币凭空出现。按公开报道，多家交易所暂停了 BEC 充提。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.484,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 59.582,
   "speechEnd": 64.77
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "到了 0.8 版以后，算术默认检查溢出。",
   "spoken": "到了 0.8 版以后，算术默认检查溢出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 65.824,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 65.922,
   "speechEnd": 68.886
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "但有三处，仍会静默回绕：unchecked 块，内联汇编，类型转换。",
   "spoken": "但有三处，仍会静默回绕：unchecked 块，内联汇编，类型转换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 69.956,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 70.054,
   "speechEnd": 75.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "移位运算也不检查溢出。",
   "spoken": "移位运算也不检查溢出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 76.704,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 76.802,
   "speechEnd": 78.683
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第二类，截断。大类型转成小类型，高位被丢掉，不报错。",
   "spoken": "第二类，截断。大类型转成小类型，高位被丢掉，不报错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 79.756,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 79.854,
   "speechEnd": 85.339
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "第三类，先除后乘。看一组小数字：7 乘 3，除以 5。",
   "spoken": "第三类，先除后乘。看一组小数字：7 乘 3，除以 5。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.384,
   "dur": 6.192,
   "speechStart": 86.482,
   "speechEnd": 91.765
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "先除，7 除以 5 等于 1，余数丢掉。再乘 3，结果是 3。",
   "spoken": "先除，7 除以 5 等于 1，余数丢掉。再乘 3，结果是 3。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 92.796,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 92.894,
   "speechEnd": 98.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "先乘，7 乘 3 等于 21，再除以 5，结果是 4。",
   "spoken": "先乘，7 乘 3 等于 21，再除以 5，结果是 4。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 99.328,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 99.426,
   "speechEnd": 103.402
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "先除的结果少了 1。丢掉的误差，被后面的乘法放大了。",
   "spoken": "先除的结果少了 1。丢掉的误差，被后面的乘法放大了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 104.444,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 104.542,
   "speechEnd": 109.063
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "所以要先乘后除。更好的做法，是用 mulDiv。",
   "spoken": "所以要先乘后除。更好的做法，是用 mulDiv。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 110.112,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 110.21,
   "speechEnd": 114.505
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "它的中间结果有 512 位，不会溢出，并且能指定舍入方向。",
   "spoken": "它的中间结果有 512 位，不会溢出，并且能指定舍入方向。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 115.564,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 115.662,
   "speechEnd": 120.412
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "第四类舍入方向，下一段讲。先看第五类，单位不一致。",
   "spoken": "第四类舍入方向，下一段讲。先看第五类，单位不一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 121.472,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 121.57,
   "speechEnd": 126.734
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "同样叫 USDT，以太坊上是 6 位小数，TRON 上也是 6 位。",
   "spoken": "同样叫 USDT，以太坊上是 6 位小数，TRON 上也是 6 位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 127.788,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 127.886,
   "speechEnd": 132.802
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "BNB Chain 上的 BSC-USD，却是 18 位。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain 上的 BSC-USD，却是 18 位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
   "start": 133.864,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 133.962,
   "speechEnd": 137.307
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "把以太坊的代码原样搬过去，又写死了 6 位精度。",
   "spoken": "把以太坊的代码原样搬过去，又写死了 6 位精度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-25.mp3",
   "start": 138.356,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 138.454,
   "speechEnd": 142.263
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-26",
   "text": "USDT 金额，就会被放大 10 的 12 次方倍。",
   "spoken": "USDT 金额，就会被放大 10 的 12 次方倍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-26.mp3",
   "start": 143.328,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 143.426,
   "speechEnd": 146.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-27",
   "text": "规则只有一句：永远从合约读取 decimals，不要写死。",
   "spoken": "规则只有一句：永远从合约读取 decimals，不要写死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-27.mp3",
   "start": 147.628,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 147.726,
   "speechEnd": 151.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-28",
   "text": "跨链桥两端精度不同时，要显式换算，并处理换算后的余数。",
   "spoken": "跨链桥两端精度不同时，要显式换算，并楚理换算后的余数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg2-28.mp3",
   "start": 152.936,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 153.034,
   "speechEnd": 157.438
  }
